~ start
% Lady P: Hello dearie!
% Lady P: Ooh, what a lovely place this is to stop by!
%
	Lady P: Awww, seems you got a pet froggy! How cute!
	Master Frogg: Hey! Hands off! I'm not some pet!

match Globals.wantedPotionType: # this is a placeholder while we set up a global variable for the wanted potions
	when "Potion of Mogging":
		Lady P: I heard the people talk about "Looksmaxxing", I'd like to try!
	when "Potion of Beautification":
		Lady P: Help me be the prettiest princess there ever was!
	when "Potion of Rapid Shaking":
		Lady P: I wanna get the shakies!
	when "Potion of Eye Colour Swap":
		Lady P: I think a change of eye colour could be nice!
	when "Potion of Permanent Smile":
		Lady P: I wanna always have a bright smile on my face!
	when "Potion of Green Skin":
		Lady P: I'd like to be green like a grassy hill!
	when "Potion of Curing":
		Lady P: I think I caught a fever earlier, do you think you can help?
	when "Potion of Baldness":
		Lady P: I think I want to try regrowing my hair, could you get rid of it?
	when "Potion of Head Size Increase":
		Lady P: I want to have a little head, just to see what it's like.
	when "Potion of Head Size Decrease":
		Lady P: I want to make my head bigger to help shout my joys better!
	when "Potion of Creature Feature":
		Lady P: I'd like to be featured as the best creature in the lands!
	when "Potion of Rabies":
		Lady P: I would like to fill my mouth with bubbles!
	when "Potion of Change Language":
		Lady P: I'd like to try communicating in a new way, think you can help?
	when "Potion of Change Art Styles":
		Lady P: I want to see what things are like in a different style!
	when "Potion of Body Swap":
		Lady P: I wonder what it's like to be someone else?
	when "Potion of Love":
		Lady P: I spotted someone looking handsome the other day, got anything for love?
	when "Potion of Explode":
		Lady P: I want to fill with so much joy that I'll burst!
	when "Potion of Skeleton":
		Lady P: Could you get me a spooky and scary for Halloween?
	when "Potion of Enlarge Person":
		Lady P: I wish that I was giant so I could hug everyone easier!
	when "Potion of Shrink Person":
		Lady P: I wish that I could be the size of a bunny!
	else:
		Lady P: Surprise me!

- Confirm

=> END